# A number field by mouse and keys (3-E3c). `amount` is x 0..100, y 0..24,
# 0..1000 by 1 at 20; `off` is x 200..300 and disabled; the button is x
# 300..380. Values stay inside the range: vapors clamps a typed value on
# commit and Chromium does not, so that case is pinned by vapors' own
# tests, not here.
listen pointerdown pointerup click input change keydown keyup focusin focusout
click 50 12                   a click focuses amount; a text field always shows the ring
expect event click input#amount
expect focus-visible input#amount
expect value input#amount 20
type "5"                      typed after the caret, at the end: 205
expect event input input#amount
expect value input#amount 205
key Backspace                 back to 20
expect event input input#amount
expect value input#amount 20
type "a"                      a letter is not typed into a number field
expect no event input
expect value input#amount 20
key Backspace                 2
expect value input#amount 2
type "7"                      27
expect value input#amount 27
key Enter                     commits: change
expect event change input#amount
expect value input#amount 27
key Enter                     committed already: no change
expect no event change
key ArrowUp                   a step, with input and change
expect event input input#amount
expect event change input#amount
expect value input#amount 28
key ArrowDown
expect value input#amount 27
key Tab                       on to plain; the value was committed by the arrow, so no change
expect no event change
expect focus-visible input#plain
key Shift+Tab                 back by keyboard: the text is selected whole
expect focus-visible input#amount
type "9"                      replaces it: 9
expect event input input#amount
expect value input#amount 9
click 340 12                  the button: amount blurs and commits
expect event focusout input#amount
expect event change input#amount
expect focus button#after
expect value input#amount 9
click 250 12                  off is disabled: no click, no focus
expect event pointerdown input#off
expect no event click
expect focus body
key ArrowUp                   with nothing focused, nothing steps
expect no event input
